2026-07-27T09:40:48.2493039Z i /tmp/Rtmpoa5KQs/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:40:48.2493445Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:40:48.2493925Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:40:48.2494335Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:40:48.2494971Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:40:48.2495920Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:40:48.2496921Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
